    "detailed_description": "The Impossible Knight Runner is an intense hack-and-slash platformer full of creatures trying to put an end to your adventure.<br><br>Choose your knight, enter the dungeon and show no mercy, because no one will go easy on you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Intense Gameplay:</strong></li></ul>One life. No checkpoints. Lot's of enemies. Once you start moving you have to keep going.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlockable Content:</strong></li></ul>Unlock new characters, levels and game modes as you progress through the game.<br><br><br>It's not going to be easy... and remember: Keep on moving!",
    "about_the_game": "The Impossible Knight Runner is an intense hack-and-slash platformer full of creatures trying to put an end to your adventure.<br><br>Choose your knight, enter the dungeon and show no mercy, because no one will go easy on you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Intense Gameplay:</strong></li></ul>One life. No checkpoints. Lot's of enemies. Once you start moving you have to keep going.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlockable Content:</strong></li></ul>Unlock new characters, levels and game modes as you progress through the game.<br><br><br>It's not going to be easy... and remember: Keep on moving!",
